# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# URL history:
#   Sprint 1 origin      /audit/                    and /audit/restaurants/
#   First restructure    /tools/                    and /tools/restaurant-audit/
#   Current structure    /tools/ /tools/audits/ and /tools/audits/restaurant/
#
# The /tools/ category exists so we can expand beyond audits over time
# (generators, converters, analyzers, etc.) without another restructure.
# All legacy paths redirect forward to the current structure so external
# backlinks to any historical URL land correctly and pass SEO equity.
#
# Ordering matters: more specific paths come before their wildcards so
# Cloudflare Pages matches the exact rule first.

# Second restructure: /tools/restaurant-audit/ -> /tools/audits/restaurant/
/tools/restaurant-audit/     /tools/audits/restaurant/    301
/tools/restaurant-audit/*    /tools/audits/restaurant/:splat   301

# First restructure: /audit/* -> /tools/*
# Point the old /audit/restaurants/ path directly at the current
# /tools/audits/restaurant/ location so chained redirects don't
# waste a hop.
/audit/restaurants/          /tools/audits/restaurant/    301
/audit/                      /tools/                      301
/audit/*                     /tools/:splat                301

